"""Rate limiting & auth-abuse protection — fail-open, plan tiering, key scoping, the 429 path.

Runs with NO Redis (and, in one case, a deliberately DEAD Redis), which is the important case: the
whole subsystem must degrade OPEN, so a limiter outage allows traffic instead of rejecting it. The
enforcement paths are exercised against in-memory fakes injected at the ``RateLimitPort`` seam, so
the tests are deterministic and need no infrastructure.
"""

